@startuml pagos
!theme plain
left to right direction
title Use cases — Payments module

actor Escribano
actor "Receptionist / Clerk (Gestor)" as ReceptionistClerk
actor Client

rectangle "Payments module" {
  usecase "CU15 - Procesar pago" as CU15
  usecase "CU47 - Consultar Pago" as CU47
}

usecase "CU19 - Buscar gestiones de un Cliente\n(from Clientes)" as CU19
usecase "CU60 - Buscar Presupuesto\n(from Presupuesto)" as CU60

Escribano --> CU15 : needs
Escribano --> CU47 : needs
ReceptionistClerk --> CU47 : needs
Client --> CU15 : requests

CU15 ..> CU19 : <<include>>
CU15 ..> CU60 : <<include>>
CU47 ..> CU19 : <<include>>
CU47 ..> CU60 : <<include>>

@enduml
